{"municipality_code":"30202","pref":"和歌山県","city":"海南市","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"海南市には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは港町・水運、社寺・地域信仰、近代化・産業遺産に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では小野田寛郎や湯川宏に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「黒江」や「漆器」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":87,"rank":675,"percentile":64.2,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":3,"rank":1182,"percentile":34.7,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":73,"rank":245,"percentile":86.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":10,"rank":822,"percentile":51.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":35,"rank":97,"percentile":94.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":17,"rank":214,"percentile":87.6,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":3,"rank":184,"percentile":83.2,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":66,"rank":267,"percentile":85.8,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["小野田寛郎","湯川宏","田嶋一雄","斎東満"],"tourism_landma